 class=\"mcpui-secret-icon-hide\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M9.9 4.24A9.1 9.1 0 0 1 12 4c6.5 0 10 7 10 7a17.8 17.8 0 0 1-2.16 3.19M6.6 6.6C3.9 8.4 2 12 2 12s3.5 7 10 7a9.7 9.7 0 0 0 5.4-1.6M14.12 14.12a3 3 0 1 1-4.24-4.24\"/><path d=\"M2 2l20 20\"/></svg></button></div>\n</div>\n</fieldset>\n<div class=\"mcpui-actions\">\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"mcpui-button mcpui-button-primary\" data-mcpui-action=\"submit\" data-agent-element=\"mcpui-action-submit\" data-agent-role=\"button\" data-agent-label=\"Save token\">Save token</button>\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"mcpui-button\" data-mcpui-action=\"cancel\" data-agent-element=\"mcpui-action-cancel\" data-agent-role=\"button\" data-agent-label=\"Cancel\">Cancel</button>\n</div>\n</form>\n<p class=\"mcpui-status\" id=\"mcpui-status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" data-state=\"idle\"></p>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>"
